  "details": "VRChat Version:\n2022.1.1p3 (oculus desktop) also observed this bug in steam version\nDescription of the bug:\nIf the active microphone used in VRChat is disconnected and the device automatically changes to a new device the device name on the quick settings doesn't changes to reflect that\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n(In the screenshot, the mic I'm using is muted physically so it should not have any voice level unless vrc switches to a new mic)\n1. set the microphone device \n2. unplug or disconnected that mic\n3. check the current device listed name, the name should still stay the same but vrc will be picking up on a different device",
